==============================================================================

MedOrbits -- Root Git Ignore Policy

File: .gitignore

Policy version: 3.1.0

Purpose:

Exclude local secrets, credentials, dependencies, runtime state, caches,

temporary files and generated artifacts without hiding maintained source.

Security:

.gitignore is not a secrets-management system. It does not untrack files

already committed or remove secrets from Git history.

Maintenance:

Review patterns against the actual repository before adoption.

==============================================================================

