*.zip, *.7z, *.rar, *.tar, *.tar.gz, *.pdf, *.png, *.jpg, *.xlsx

Archives, PDFs, images and spreadsheets may be required public assets,

official documents, release artifacts or approved project resources.

Add narrow rules for specific generated directories when needed.

